Better? This one is one 60-minute block per day. Day 1 is begripslees teksontleding, day 2 is opsomming, day 3 is taalstrukture konvensies. The weak bits — poesie gedigontleding and roman drama letterkunde — get 120 minutes each, and past papers get 120 minutes too. The final day is a 30-minute light review. One hour a day is like eating a vetkoek — you can't do it in one bite, but one bite a day and it's gone. Want to lock this in?

Die plan is nie lukraak nie. Jou drie swak Matematika-onderwerpe kry elk 225 minute. Die ander Matematika-onderwerpe kry 90 tot 135 minute. Jy kry ook 270 minute vir Afrikaans-vraestelle en 270 minute vir Wiskunde-vraestelle. Swak onderwerpe kry meer tyd, nie minder nie. Kan jy vir my sê hoekom jy dink die swak onderwerpe kry die meeste minute?

